  "description": {
    "raw": "You gain temporary insight into your enemies’ magical defenses.\nWhen you next cast a spell before the end of the next round,\ntreat your caster level as 5 higher than normal for the purpose of\novercoming spell resistance. This bonus doesn’t increase any other\neffects that depend on caster level, such as the spell’s damage or\nrange, and affects only the first spell cast after sure casting.",
    "search_text": "\"you gain temporary insight into your enemies’ magical defenses.\\nwhen you next cast a spell before the end of the next round,\\ntreat your caster level as 5 higher than normal for the purpose of\\novercoming spell resistance. this bonus doesn’t increase any other\\neffects that depend on caster level, such as the spell’s damage or\\nrange, and affects only the first spell cast after sure casting.\"",
